{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">Le soin tout-en-un</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "ss_rating": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-rating', product: product %}"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "ss_complements": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-complements', items: \"recharge-serum-104-multi-boosting-serum-the-c||Garde ton flacon, recharge la formule;creme-tout-en-un-104-one-cream-the-c||À appliquer juste après le sérum\", title: \"Pense à la suite\", note: \"La recharge pour plus tard, et la crème de la même ligne.\" %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Pour qui</b>Tous types de peau, y compris sensibles et mixtes</div><div><b>Texture</b>Fluide léger, vite absorbé</div><div><b>Flacon</b>Airless rechargeable, ou format nomade 10 ml</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "acc_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Composition (INCI)",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Water (Aqua), Glycerin, Propanediol, Trehalose, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Panthenol, Cudrania Tricuspidata Bark Extract, Butylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polyisobutene, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Lactobacillus Ferment Lysate, Xanthan Gum, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Sorbitan Oleate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Lactobacillus/Soybean Ferment Extract, Lactobacillus/Rice Ferment Filtrate, Lactobacillus/Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, Saccharomyces/Coix Lacryma-Jobi Ma-Yuen Seed Ferment Filtrate, Saccharomyces/Potato Extract Ferment Filtrate, Ceramide AP, Ceramide NP, Ceramide NS, Ceramide EOP.</p><p><em>Cette liste peut évoluer : se référer à l'emballage du produit acheté.</em></p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Précautions",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Usage externe. Éviter le contact avec les yeux ; en cas de contact, rincer abondamment à l'eau claire. En cas de réaction inhabituelle, cesser l'utilisation et consulter un médecin. Conserver à l'abri du soleil et de la chaleur.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_rating",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_complements",
        "ss_facts",
        "reassurance",
        "acc_1",
        "acc_2",
        "sticky_atc"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (min-width: 1280px) {.product {padding-inline: 5rem; }}"
